    "Title": "Show HN: Waymark \u2013 A workflow engine that compiles jobs instead of replaying",
    "Url": "https://github.com/piercefreeman/waymark",
    "Description": "Hey everyone! @mozgiii and I have been working on Waymark for the better part of the last year. Waymark\u2019s an open source durable execution library with similar functionality to Temporal or DBOS.\u003Cp\u003EI fell in love with durable execution a few years ago, after working at a company with a heavy pubsub architecture. In comparison to job orchestrators that force a certain task design or special syntax, many of these durable libs lets you write business logic in regular code: \u0060asyncio.gather\u0060 to parall",
